==Battleground==
*7 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ghost Baa Baa]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Ghost Baa Baa]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Ghost Baa Baa]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

